n omission_receipt with the full_history selector. --full-history (SDK fullHistory, MCP full) returns the whole collection. failure_categories appears only when tests ran. The implicit post-write path check covers returned links. Measurement-refusal retries replay --full-history. Flag contracts, completions, MCP schema 4.24.0, a new replication set and docs carry the contract, and the SDK surface records the breaking acknowledgement with migration guidance."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"The receipt is 900 B as JSON (the issue measured 3,335 B); 3-test and 27-test items differ by at most one byte; --full-history returns every entry on CLI, SDK and MCP"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/close_reason","value":"test, files and docs writes return only the entries they wrote with comments-style mutation and omission receipts, restorable with --full-history across CLI, SDK and MCP"}],"before_hash":"275f76fc0d0f1170f6b00e2f3297cbbd3db7887743c262f832277cb15738ba9b","after_hash":"8c3f5f215d1ee5592382f4a351a4cf85385f881050dece4834b9889345d3510e","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"completion":{"timestamp":"2026-11-11T08:02:12.961Z","source":"close_time"},"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"699602cdc404eec9a241ce84c06434d5af985b31220c586e20b5c031c4e152d7"}
